s6-1-p7 = prose (cons "For the second projection let \(A:=\mathsf{Code}(\varnothing,P\to D\to O)\), \(B:=\mathsf{Code}(\varnothing,P)\to\mathsf{Code}(\varnothing,D\to O)\), and \(G:A\to B\) be \(G(e)(q_p):=S_{P,D\to O}(e,q_p)\). At a stage that represents this *particular* \(G\), supply checked code \(q_G:\mathsf{Code}(\varnothing,A\to B)\). Because \(A\) is a syntax datatype, a typed stage-lifting function may represent an element \(e:A\) by \(\mathsf{lift}_A(e):\mathsf{Code}(\varnothing,A)\), with \(\mathsf{eval}(\mathsf{lift}_A(e))=e\). Then" nil)
